{"4899570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Amadea", "steam_appid": 4899570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scale your destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and climb your way to the summit of an ancient world in this freerunning Metroidvania adventure! Solve the mysteries of the land to correct the course of fate and save the Mountain from eternal winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899570/extras/069129fcc599559374e0b2dff8dfd04a.avif?t=1783115530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899570/extras_big/069129fcc599559374e0b2dff8dfd04a.avif?t=1783115530 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the ancient Mountain of the World! Traverse dozens of unique areas and uncover hidden secrets in a rich, hand-crafted adventure.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid &amp; expressive freerunning movement! Glide across rocks, crevasses, and cliffs as you forge your own path to the Summit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become legend! Acquire mythical abilities and powerful artifacts to bolster your acrobatic arsenal and reach new places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socialize! Encounter  quirky characters and solve their numerous quests to fulfill the destiny of the Mountain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master exhilarating challenges! Complete time trials, combo challenges, and other mini-games to prove yourself as the most daring climber of the Age.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899570/extras/9d9ad742966c2fd9f63fa0c892597a30.avif?t=1783115530\"